Package: aqmapr
Title: AQmap as an ambiorix app 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Brayden", "Nilson", email = "brayden.nilson@ec.gc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: aqmapr leverages the package `ambiorix` to produce a full-stack implementation of https://aqmap.ca/aqmap. It collects resources from the existing AQmap page and provides both convenient access points for data as well as a replicated map.
